{"slug": "type-lab", "title": "Typelab: Inspiring font exploration", "banner": {"src": "/images/cs/nb1L9sm0ryF7eEljCFOnU5ZBju4.webp", "pos": "50% 50%", "h": 480}, "head": {"t": "box", "w": 818, "h": 78, "flex": "column|12px|0px|flex-start|flex-start|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 654, "h": 43, "html": "<h1 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:36px;line-height:43.2px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Typelab: Inspiring font exploration</h1>", "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 818, "h": 23, "flex": "row|12px|0px|center|flex-start|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 51, "h": 22, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:22.4px;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic;letter-spacing:-0.28px\">Designer</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 8, "h": 23, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(203, 203, 203);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">|</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 153, "h": 22, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:22.4px;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic;letter-spacing:-0.28px\">October - November 2025</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 8, "h": 23, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(203, 203, 203);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">|</p>", "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 36, "h": 22, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:14px;line-height:22.4px;color:rgb(138, 138, 138);font-style:italic;letter-spacing:-0.28px\">Figma</p>", "single": true}], "fill": 1}]}, "layout": {"side": [179, 222], "main": [433, 900], "head": [451, 818], "headTop": 32, "tocW": 150, "tocPad": "50px", "tocGap": "25px", "tocAlign": "center"}, "toc": [{"text": "← Home", "href": "/"}, {"text": "Context", "href": "#01-context"}, {"text": "Solution", "href": "#02-solution"}, {"text": "MVP", "href": "#03-mvp"}, {"text": "Iterations", "href": "#04-iterations"}, {"text": "Reflection", "href": "#05-reflection"}], "content": {"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 5727, "flex": "column|70px|50px 0px 0px|center|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"id": "01-context", "reveal": 1, "t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 197, "flex": "column|10px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"id": "01-context-1", "t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 197, "flex": "column|24px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 197, "flex": "column|8px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 21, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(210, 210, 210)\">CONTEXT</h5>", "fill": 1, "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 38, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:30px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">An app to inspire font discovery &amp; learning</h3>", "fill": 1, "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 122, "flex": "row|20px|0px|flex-start|flex-start|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 122, "flex": "column|32px|0px|flex-start|flex-start|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 90, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">As a kid, I spent hours browsing through google fonts and obsessing over the nuances between various serifs, sans serifs and scripts. I wanted to design a community based app that allows users to learn and discover new fonts, and allow amateurs to create and sell their own fonts.</p>", "single": false}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}]}, {"id": "02-solution", "reveal": 1, "t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 2609, "flex": "column|24px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 258, "flex": "row|10px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 593, "h": 258, "flex": "column|8px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 593, "h": 21, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(210, 210, 210)\">SOLUTION</h5>", "fill": 1, "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 593, "h": 38, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:30px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">\"omg! Your handwriting looks like a font!\"</h3>", "fill": 1, "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 593, "h": 183, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">Back in elementary school when I put effort into making my handwriting legible (and not complete chicken scratch), my classmates have told me that they wish they had my handwriting!</p><p style=\"margin-top:15px;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">I think a lot of people (designers and non-designers alike) have been told that their handwriting is pretty and they wished it was a font. While there is a lot of design decisions that go into creating professional typefaces, I think there is definitely a demand / interest in more casually created fonts that people can easily share &amp; download to use on personal projects / note-taking.</p>", "fill": 1, "single": false}]}, {"br": "7px", "t": "video", "w": 297, "h": 150, "src": "/media/cs/8eklpTtSLpkQ5SM5LBMgg84Xk4.mp4", "fit": "cover", "poster": null}], "fill": 1, "stack": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 535, "flex": "row|10px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 535, "flex": "column|8px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 38, "flex": "column|10px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 38, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:30px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\" data-align=\"center\">Discover professional &amp; amateur typefaces</h3>", "fill": 1, "single": true}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 480, "h": 489, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 480, "h": 489, "src": "/images/cs/AHLXsxmppvuZ71c78JpOPVAzf0.webp", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "fill": 1}]}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 575, "flex": "column|8px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 38, "flex": "column|10px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 38, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:30px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\" data-align=\"center\">Create your own typefaces</h3>", "fill": 1, "single": true}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 786, "h": 529, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 786, "h": 529, "src": "/images/cs/ebsJSpa14Y86zIkdk22DMV16ns.webp", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "fill": 1}]}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 572, "flex": "column|8px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 38, "flex": "column|10px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 38, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:30px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\" data-align=\"center\">Publish your fonts and join a community</h3>", "fill": 1, "single": true}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 522, "h": 526, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 522, "h": 526, "src": "/images/cs/4fC9jlpvPTD8oTHzW7PGAhcoGg.webp", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "fill": 1}]}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 573, "flex": "column|8px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 38, "flex": "column|10px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 38, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:30px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\" data-align=\"center\">Learn what makes a font unique</h3>", "fill": 1, "single": true}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 786, "h": 527, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 786, "h": 527, "src": "/images/cs/tnIc6uglz4ZMTSIH1tIfoBFunw.webp", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "fill": 1}]}], "fill": 1}]}, {"id": "03-mvp", "reveal": 1, "t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 691, "flex": "row|10px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 691, "flex": "column|10px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 691, "flex": "column|8px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 21, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(210, 210, 210)\">CREATING AN MVP</h5>", "fill": 1, "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 103, "flex": "row|24px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 103, "flex": "column|8px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 38, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:30px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Designing a user flow</h3>", "fill": 1, "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 57, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">Keeping the project brief at the forefront of my ideating phase, I created an information architecture to display the screen requirements. </p><p style=\"margin-top:15px;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">I then made wireframes that aligned with my information architecture.</p>", "fill": 1, "single": false}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 551, "flex": "row|10px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 387, "h": 337, "kids": [{"t": "img", "w": 387, "h": 337, "src": "/images/cs/a4eyo928yZa8UiKLmrxbxA4vzA.webp", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "fill": 1}]}, {"br": "10px", "t": "box", "w": 503, "h": 551, "kids": [{"br": "10px", "t": "img", "w": 503, "h": 551, "src": "/images/cs/6mGRstYndGFvtR8Ya5HvuKirlTc.webp", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0]}], "frame": 1}], "fill": 1, "stack": 1}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}]}, {"id": "04-iterations", "reveal": 1, "t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 1712, "flex": "column|32px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 170, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 21, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(210, 210, 210)\">ITERATIONS</h5>", "fill": 1, "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 38, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:30px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Navigation bar?</h3>", "fill": 1, "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 95, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">At first, I did not want to include a navigation bar because the goal of the app was simple: discover new fonts and learn about them.</p><p style=\"margin-top:5px;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">However, as I designed additional features a navigation bar became increasingly necessary.</p>", "single": false}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 814, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 38, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:30px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Branding &amp; high contrast text</h3>", "fill": 1, "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 90, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">I kept the colours minimal to emphasize the qualities of the typefaces. I was happy with a pure grayscale app but wanted to play around with beige-sepia color. Ultimately I felt that black and white felt more visually pleasing and better represented common typeface use cases. </p>", "single": false}, {"br": "20px", "t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 670, "kids": [{"br": "20px", "t": "img", "w": 900, "h": 670, "src": "/images/cs/GXLxSaQpZPS4JupLmkCPc4gkOg.webp", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0]}], "fill": 1, "frame": 1}], "fill": 1}, {"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 664, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 38, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:30px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Reframing the brief to sprinkle in some whimsy…</h3>", "fill": 1, "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 213, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">Because this project was a design exploration rather than a functional build, I had complete creative freedom — with no technical or business limitations — to guide the app’s concept. I had multiple ideas ranging from games to help users quickly identify fonts, community upvotes, and even AR type viewers to visualize fonts in real-world contexts (such as signage or posters). </p><p style=\"margin-top:5px;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77);letter-spacing:-0.3px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-top:5px;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">However, I found myself most excited to work on features that dealt with community and accessibility. I often find that the typography community can be a bit daunting to enter, so I wanted to make that experience as effortless as possible. </p>", "single": false}, {"br": "16px", "t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 397, "kids": [{"br": "16px", "t": "img", "w": 900, "h": 397, "src": "/images/cs/M4qEzWHEmN5AFauNSyauBHpYN5s.webp", "fit": "cover", "pos": "50% 50%", "abs": [0, 0]}], "fill": 1, "frame": 1}], "fill": 1}]}, {"id": "05-reflection", "reveal": 1, "t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 188, "flex": "column|10px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 188, "flex": "column|8px|0px|center|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 21, "html": "<h5 style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:14px;line-height:21px;color:rgb(210, 210, 210)\">REFLECTION</h5>", "fill": 1, "single": true}, {"t": "box", "w": 900, "h": 159, "flex": "column|8px|0px|flex-start|center|nowrap", "clip": 1, "kids": [{"t": "text", "w": 900, "h": 38, "html": "<h3 style=\"font-family:var(--serif);font-size:24px;line-height:30px;color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Avoid choice overload while allowing in-depth exploration</h3>", "fill": 1, "single": true}, {"t": "text", "w": 600, "h": 113, "html": "<p style=\"font-family:var(--sans);font-size:15px;line-height:22.5px;color:rgb(77, 77, 77);letter-spacing:-0.3px\">Initially, I had my typefaces compactly displayed. Users were able to view upwards of 15 font choices at the same time. To avoid overwhelming the user and hurting users' decision-making ability, I adjusted the line spacing between the fonts by nearly double. As a result, a maximum of 7 options are shown at any specific moment allowing for users to better view each font. </p>", "single": false}], "fill": 1}], "fill": 1}]}]}, "accent": "rgb(210, 210, 210)"}